		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  migration  9.0.11 -postgis 1.5.3 en  9.3 - 1.2.1 ( srid en st_srid)]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=19892#p19892"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>j&#039;ai fait ceci sur la nouvelle version de postgres </p><p>CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION srid(geometry)<br />&#160; RETURNS integer AS<br />&#039;$libdir/postgis-2.1&#039;, &#039;LWGEOM_get_srid&#039;<br />&#160; LANGUAGE c IMMUTABLE STRICT<br />&#160; COST 1;<br />ALTER FUNCTION srid(geometry)<br />&#160; OWNER TO postgres;</p><p>et a priori ma table se creé ai ce la bonne solution ? merci</p>]]></content>
